# Boot-time reconcile of the OFFLINE RETROACHIEVEMENTS toggle (fork #165):
# 099-networkservices reads STATE, rewrites the marker the unit conditions
# on and starts or stops the daemon. system.cfg is the record that travels
# in a settings backup; the marker under /storage/.cache does not, so a
# restored device with the toggle on gets its marker and its service back at
# the next boot without being asked anything.
STATE=$(get_setting global.retroachievements.offlineproxy)
SVC="raofflineproxy"
CONF="raofflineproxy.conf"
DAEMONS=("raofflineproxy")
